<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported the</p>
<p>following Brazilian soybean and products basis levels.</p>
<p>(B-Buyer S-Seller T-Trade P-Premium D-Discount)</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	BASIS	 MONTH	  PREV</p>
<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> September     40/50 P     September    40/50 P</p>
<p> 15Mar/15Apr  4 D/Even     15Mar/15Apr  4 D/Even</p>
<p> May/97	   15/8 D     May/97	  11/7 D</p>
<p> July/97	unquoted     July/97	 10/4 D</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS     MONTH	 PREV</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> September	  8/6 D  September	 8/6 D</p>
<p> October	    2/1 D  October	   2/1 D</p>
<p> December	   3/6 P  December	  3/6 P</p>
<p> January/97	3/10 P  January	  3/10 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT    BASIS	 MONTH	PREV</p>
<p>Soybean Oil (dollars per tonne, points per lb, crude, degummed)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> September   190/180 D   September  190/180 D</p>
<p> October     170/140 D   October    170/140 D</p>
<p> December    150/110 D   December   150/110 D</p>
<p> May/97	unquoted    May/97     unquoted</p>
